  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "分层与依赖方向",
      "items": [
        "composeApp 装配 → 17 个 feature 业务模块 → component 端口 → 10 个 core 模块，依赖单向向下",
        "feature 之间禁止互相依赖，由 scripts/check-layer-deps.sh 静态门禁强制",
        "库模块均不产二进制：iOS framework 与 OHOS libkn.so 只由 :composeApp 产出"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "三端入口细节",
      "items": [
        "Android：MainActivity 走 installSplashScreen → enableEdgeToEdge → setContent",
        "iOS：MainViewController / SwiftUI ContentView 承载 Compose Island（ADR 0002）",
        "OHOS：MainArkUIViewController 由 ArkTS Index.ets 经 libkn.so 加载"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "网络与会话链路",
      "items": [
        "Ktor：ohosArm64 用 CIO，ohosX64 走 net_http cinterop 回退",
        "逐请求头注入 Authorization + X-Session-ID + X-Device-ID，空白值省略",
        "401 静默刷新由 AuthRefreshingApiClient 独占；SSE / WS 走增量流"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "后端契约与持久化",
      "items": [
        "94 条 /api/v1/* 逐条对照 Go 后端 16 域路由，后端为唯一真相源",
        "audit-flutter-drift.sh 以 36 条书面 allowlist 归零，未登记差异仍 exit 1",
        "KV 走 core:storage（OHOS 为 OH_Preferences），结构化表默认 InMemory driver"
      ]
    }
  ]
